  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Enhancement: ODS round trips preserve more package parts and workbook structures; existing workbook and export APIs gain concrete style, filtering, PivotTable, connection, revision, image, and PDF controls.\n    - Bug fix: VBA containers, Agile-encrypted workbooks, chart layouts, conditional-formatting, annotations, and conversion edge cases are preserved or handled more reliably.\n  - New feature: PDF and image rendering is available for worksheets and cell ranges, with image DPI, layout, naming, and format controls plus PDF compliance, security, bookmark, metadata, hidden-sheet, gridline, and row/column-heading options.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
